   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I have installed Rattle 4.0.5 along with R 3.2.3 on Red hat enterprise linux 5.4 /</div><div><br></div><div>Here is my Rattleinfo():</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Rattle: version 4.0.5 CRAN 4.1.0\r\nR: version 3.2.3 (2015-12-10)\r\n\r\nSysname: Linux\r\nRelease: 2.6.18-164.el5\r\nVersion: #1 SMP Tue Aug 18 15:51:48 EDT 2009</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Installed Dependencies\r\ncluster: version 2.0.3\r\nforeign: version 0.8-66\r\nMatrix: version 1.2-3\r\nnnet: version 7.3-11 upgrade available 7.3-12\r\nrpart: version 4.1-10\r\nstringr: version 1.0.0\r\nsurvival: version 2.38-3\r\n\r\nThat was 8 packages.</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">When  i run rattle  then i get the following error</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\">rattle()\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in as.GType(type) : Cannot convert RGtkBuilder to GType.</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">I have gtk2 and gtk2-devel installed.</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Upgrading RHEL 5.4 to  6 is not an option as this is a Linux cluster.</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Any way this problem can be solved ?</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre></pre></div></div>"
