     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">According to <a href=\"http://rattle.togaware.com/rattle-install-troubleshooting.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rattle.togaware.com/rattle-install-troubleshooting.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478372565000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xwDUKkdnrMDejxw3b1RXS\">http://rattle.togaware.com/rattle-install-troubleshooting.html</a> the likely problem is the use of an old version of gtk2. You may need to find an updated version of gtk2 that is compiled for RHEL 5.4<br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\">Regards,<br>Graham Williams<br></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
